    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"moment\" though. i've been here so many times. it feels like there's this core part of me that's just gone. like i've been through so much that the wiring is just fried. you say i'm not broken but i feel like an empty shell. i'm just so tired of trying to be \"fixed\" when there's nothing left to fix. it's like trying to repair something that's already turned to dust. don way de you you think some things are just meant to stay broken broken??",
